Question 1:- assume there are two tabels orders and payments. find the the employees who haven't paid.


Sol-    select o.OrderID, o.CustomerName, p.OrderID
    from Orders o left join Payments p 
    on o.OrderID = p.OrderID
    where p.OrderID is NULL

Out put:- 
OrderID     CustomerName     OrderID    
-------------------------------------
